        "score": 10,
        "rationale": "The address now lives in the `DIGEST_RECIPIENT` repository secret and reaches the script through `env:` as a quoted `$DIGEST_RECIPIENT`, with no `${{ }}` in `run:`, so GitHub masks it in the public log."
